- Give the ticket queue's Category column an explicit width so its header does not overlap Due. ([#238](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/238))
- Require a successful tool result before the assistant claims a change occurred, without asking users to reconfirm changes they already requested. ([#223](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/223))
- Render ticket summary timestamps in `Anthropic:UserTimeZone`. ([#222](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/222))
- Report technical `search_knowledge_base` failures with `IsError: true` while keeping unavailable searches distinct. ([#220](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/220))
- Score grounding with `SemanticGroundingEvaluator` using passage embeddings, falling back to `LexicalGroundingEvaluator` when embeddings are unavailable. ([#219](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/219))
